TITLE pe for 100C Ca solution + calcite/gypsum/aragonite + gas phase
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite    0 10
    Gypsum     0 10
    Aragonite  0 10
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pe true
END
